  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "VRChat Version: 1231\nDescription of the bug:\nThe clip distances in a mirror's reflection are currently independent from the distances set by the World. For example, in Worlds that use far-clip distance as a means of obscuring other areas (for visual & performance reasons), the other areas can show up in the Personal Mirror, as well as in-world mirrors.\nDepending on the needs of the world, this can be a performance & visual issue (with no known workaround, in the case of the Personal Mirror).\nSteps to reproduce:\n1. Load a world that utilises far-clip distance (e.g. Furality F.Y.N.N.'s Room)\n2. Activate personal mirror\n3. Look around through the mirror to find something that would be obscured by far-clip, and things will be visible that otherwise shouldn't be.",
